window.products.push({"id":607144,"name":"MagikFlame Electric Fireplace with Mantel - Trinity White - 30 Flames, Large, Freestanding, 5,200 BTU Heater, Crackling Log Sound, Bluetooth, App - Ne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3795.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Pn8nUy2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FOR NEW HOMES, REMODELS: Whether you are an interior designer, architect, or electric fireplace enthusiast, a MagikFlame is ideal for any living space. Our Trinity is a large white, freestanding electric fireplace that is a cozy focal point for the family atmosphere. It also includes built-in 5,200 BTU infrared quartz heater, warms up to 1,000 sq/ft. as secondary heat source. MOST REALISTIC ELECTRIC FIREPLACE: 26 ultra-realistic flames that simulate wood, gas fires. We use patented HoloFlame video technology of actual burning fire. This innovative experience surpasses traditional mechanical electric fireplace products on the market. MagikFlame is ideal for new home design, remodels, and family atmosphere. ATTRACTIVE AND PRACTICAL DESIGN: 55″w x 48″h x 18”d. The premium, alpine white mantel is simple and compact. This traditional mantle has a luxury finish and perfect for homes and condominiums to add opulent beauty with ease. MADE IN THE USA: MagikFlame uses \"solid-state\" electronics with few moving parts that will last for years. Our LED and LCD technology is rated at 50,000 hours. When we ship a fireplace, have confidence that it is built to last. MULTI OPERATING USE WITH PHONE: Touchscreen and iPhone App for the latest mobile integration. These intuitive and easy to use controls can be used from any room in the home. Features an app for flame selection, power functions, volume levels, heat control, sleep timer, and nature sounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Pn8nUy2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MagikFlame","source_asin":"B07JLWVJ7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JLWVJ7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JLWVJ7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":607145,"name":"Hero Academia Poster Japanese Anime Manga Wall Art Print Decor 16x20 Inches High Quality Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1I4fXgr2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When I was younger I bought a lot of posters and I would put them up all over my room. I was very happy about them at the time. They were of all the things I loved and was proud of my collection. One day that all shattered though. I brought friends over and showed them my proud collection and then things got ugly from there. They said it was very \"sloppy\" and the paper were all \"crumbly\". They were not impressed and I was just embarrassed! This is the reason why I find the quality of the paper and ink is so important. You have the poster on your wall for the world to see. The reason for the poster is to decorate your environment and the last thing you want to do is make it look worst. The low quality posters I bought started to look despicable everyday until I finally ripped them off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1I4fXgr2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Superior Posters","source_asin":"B073SC3DCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073SC3DCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073SC3DCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
