window.products.push({"id":607428,"name":"YISUYA 24K Colorful Gold Rose, Artificial Flowers Rainbow Rose Flowers, Forever Love Rose Flowers Gift,, Gift for Girlfriend & Friend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-lNPjyWLS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"❤YISUYA-24K Rose Gold Story:The bright appearance of the rose never wither, and it has maintained an amazing elegance for thousands of years.Now, the \"Eternal Rose\" combines these lasting rainbow-like petals into an eternal, prestigious gift.Colorful roses are like beautiful messengers, conveying an indescribable and colorful love to the world.🎁Giving her the gift of immortal roses made her love life with surprises, and gave them a symbol of luxury, symbolizing the love they deserve.In every woman's dream, love is as fresh and lively as a rose. Seeing it is as beautiful and charming as the big smile on her face.😊Why choose YISUYA rose?🌹1. Never wither, love forever🌹2. The love base can be assembled and disassembled🌹3. Exquisite gift box, more ritual sense🌹4. Convenient storage, never fade🌹5. Easy to carry and use directly🌹6. A variety of occasions, a wide range of applications🎉Application occasions:Gold-plated roses can be used as gifts for Mother's Day, birthday, Christmas and other holidays.Great gifts for lovers for anniversary, engagement, Valentine's Day, etc.It is used for exquisite decoration in home, office, business or other places.Specification:Material: plastic, polyethyleneColor: colorfulSize: 9 x 1 x 3.5inPacking: 1*rose, 1*love base, 1*color ribbon, 1*packing box🌷Roses can show what people most want to say to each other, and what they do especially for each other. If you offer a rose on every special day, you will be able to sit with them, remember those good times, and feel very happy together.We use high-quality materials to make colorful roses to serve our valued customers. Our mission is to bring you satisfaction and benefits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-lNPjyWLS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YISUYA","source_asin":"B08Z864ML3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z864ML3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z864ML3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
