window.products.push({"id":607492,"name":"Ultra Soft Nurse Blanket Microfiber Plush Sherpa Blanket Gifts for Women Nurses Warm Cozy Fuzzy Throw Blanket for Bed and Couch(Nurse-1,(59'' x 79''))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815lwwtHJgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sizes: This throw blanket comes in two sizes 130cm ×150cm (51inches × 59 inches) ? 150cm ×200cm (59 inches × 79inches) .  Description: Feature :Anti-Pilling?Durable Pattern : Nurse Theme Material Type : Microfiber Plush Grade : High Quality Advantages : Comfortable,Soft  1. Please purchase the correct size as needed. Large enough to wrap you up. 2. Pattern printed on one side and solid color on the other side. It is fuzzy and thick, also very friendly to people with sensitive skin. 3.It is easily portable, and provides the perfect warmth for night sporting events. It also makes an excellent spread for picnics in damp grasses, as it tends to resist dampness, particularly if it is thick. Or one can use a thinner blanket, with a waterproof sheet beneath, to add style to picnic.  Occasions: Can be Used in Air Conditioning Room, Bedroom as Warm Blanket, Cozy up in the Couch Enjoy Favorite Movie in Winter Nights, Airplane Travel Blanket ?Outdoor Picnic Hunting Camping Beach Blankets etc. Decorative and Functional.  Q&A: 1. Can this throw blanket be washed in a washing machine? Yes! It can be washed in a washing machine, but care must be taken not to wash it with water above 60°C. 2. Is this nurse blanket free returnable? Yes! It's free returnable. Also if you have any question about this blanket please contact us and we will answer all the questions you may have. 3. How is it packaged? The blankets were vacuum packaged for better shipment. 4. Will it fade after washing? No! It's digital printing. Won't fade after long term use. 5. Is its color as vivid as picture? The color of the actual product will not be as sharp as the picture,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815lwwtHJgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QIULIBMH","source_asin":"B0B5D5345X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5D5345X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5D5345X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
