window.products.push({"id":607620,"name":"Autumn Serenity by David Lloyd Glover, 26x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cY0Lr3AdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a forest in the autumn. David Lloyd Glover has a 25 year international reputation exhibiting in major galleries in the US, Canada, Mexico and Japan. His works have been acquired by collectors all over the world. Glover creates masterworks in watercolor on paper, gouache on paper, oil on canvas and acrylic on canvas with equal facility. After a career in the advertising industry he embarked on a full time vocation of creating fine art for gallery sales. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cY0Lr3AdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKF3ATW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKF3ATW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKF3ATW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":607621,"name":"Hand-Poured Unscented Candle Dripless Pillar Candle Long Clean Burning Rustic Country Style Wedding Dinner and Home Decor, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iZlGh5NBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE CANDLES - Our pillar candles are unscented, smokeless and dripless. Perfect for creating a warm, beautiful and inviting atmosphere. Our candles are also designed to enhance any occasion or situation, whether it's a romantic dinner for two, a family gathering or simply to relax. ESSENTIAL PIECE OF DECOR - Whether you're looking for fireplace decorations for living room, or wedding decorations for ceremony, or you want just dripless candles for your home - our holiday candles pillar could fulfill all these needs! 8 inch candles would highlight each special moment of your life with warmth and amenity. PERFECT CANDLES GIFT - Beautiful handmade candle with extraordinary details. Birthdays, rehab, housewarming, weddings, teacher gifts, Christmas, baby shower, sorry, girlfriend, sister, wife, mother, anniversary or just a happy Monday or Friday or some other holiday can make people of all ages happy. HOW TO USE - We recommend using our pillar candles with plate, candle holders, or candle centerpiece to get the best experience. Although you could use them without any candlesticks. Also, our large pillar candles could be impaled on candlesticks with a spike. You could use SEUCRWAX as lanterns decorative farmhouse - they could be burned outdoor. But please remember that wind or drafts will cause the wick to bend and in this case the table candles will drip! NOTES - Because we are all 100% handmade candles, there may be some minor flaws (such as small air bubbles), but it does not affect the quality of the product. Never leave a lit candle unattended! Also keep out of reach from children and pets. If you have any other questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iZlGh5NBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEUCRWAX","source_asin":"B0BLNH3BRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLNH3BRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLNH3BRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
