window.products.push({"id":607767,"name":"60 Oh Baby Shower Advice and Prediction Cards Gold on White for Neutral Girl Boy Gender Reveal Game Activities New Parent Message Advice Book Mommy Da","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rp09Xcv8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60 Count - Oh Baby! Baby shower predictions and advice cards are in the shape of a Bodysuits and printed on both sides with gold on white. Predict the babies Date of birth, time, weight, length, eye color, hair color, and resemblance! Give these out before you make the announcement - make bets, share laughs and welcome your new bundle of joy in full cheer! Perfect Keepsake - These super fun cards can make your baby shower or gender reveal party more memorable. The cards will last for years! For Fun, put them in a scrapbook & re-read the baby prediction advice cards every birthday! These cards can be DIY, customized into a book or collage, and can be used as a precious memory when your child grows up. Easy to Write On - made of high quality thick & sturdy paper 280 grams makes them easy to write on compared to other advice or well-wishing cards. Perfect memento for baby memory books, journals, scrapbooks or guest book. Neutral for baby boys or baby girls. Impress Your Guests & Help Them Have Fun - Our game cards are ideal for large parties. Get everyone talking and working together to create a fun and engaging party atmosphere. These can be handed out as a game during a baby shower, gender reveal party & any get together to celebrate the arrival of the new baby. Dimensions - Baby Shower Prediction Cards 5.75\" x 6\" size. Design allows plenty of room for guests to write on, the back is blank for additional notes and advice for the new Mom and Dad! Great for Baby Shower Game, New Mom & Dad Card or Mommy & Daddy To Be, and New Parent Message Advice Book!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rp09Xcv8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Boutique","source_asin":"B07Y5L87SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y5L87SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y5L87SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
