window.products.push({"id":607836,"name":"Christmas Tree Topper Lighted, Christmas Tree Snowflake Topper with Rotating Santa Claus Projector, Gold Snowflake Tree Topper for Christmas Tree Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qw6JYg+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄 Magic Snowflake Projector Light: The built-in golden rotating snowflake projection light not only can keep directional movement regularly, but you can also adjust 3 direction of the LED projection to project a different gorgeous effect. Recommended distance for best effect of projection: 3.28FT from the lamp to the ceiling, (2.95-3.93FT 2.95-3.93FT can also show the projection effect very well) 🎄 Snowflake Shape Design: The Snowflake shape more matches the theme of Christmas snow, and \"gold\" symbolizes sincerity, magnificence and sparkle.3D snowflake design and covered with flashing powder, It is time to decorate your Christmas Tree! you and your loved ones decorate your tree with this pretty Snowflake and HAVE FUN WITH IT! It will turn out beautiful! 🎄 Easy to Decorate: How to install the topper? First install the topper. Then you’re finished. Just install the base of the topper on the top of the Christmas tree and adjust to the right angle. Then plug into the socket and enjoy your house's unique and fairy display. And the 10ft-long power cord can be suited for many scenarios. 🎄 SAFE & NO Overheating: Christmas Tree Decorations Topper is ideal for indoor use. The motor is quiet and allow long time use, you leave this Christmas lights up ‘til January. A sparkling snowflake tree topper that projects Santa Claus in the sky is the perfect finish to your pre-lit artificial Christmas tree. 🎄 Best Christmas Gift: The lighted snowflake tree topper can be as Christmas tree ornament,but also ideal as a LED night light projector for children. I think kids will find it amazing. I wish you an \"early\" Merry Christmas and a Wonderful, Joyous, Happy and Healthy New Year!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qw6JYg+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinikiss","source_asin":"B0B8Y5PV75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8Y5PV75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8Y5PV75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
