window.products.push({"id":607850,"name":"EBuyers 11.8\"x78\" Wide Marble Contact Paper Kitchen countertop Cabinet Furniture PVC Easy to Remove Without Leaving Mark, Marble Shelf Liner, Wallpape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f7gZ+PC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SELF-ADHESIVE & REMOVABLE- Peel off the adhesive liner and stick to any dry, flat surface. PVC material, smooth surface, easy to clean, self-adhesive. MULTI-USAGE & DECORATIVE- Suitable for covering any size cabinets, smooth countertops, notebooks, dresser drawers, handicrafts, nightstands, bookcases, shelves, doors and even walls. EASY MEASURE & CUT: The width is easy to apply, even if a person can complete the perfect decoration. This Marble Effect Paper is easy to cut and apply with measure-and-cut grid on the backing paper. Our staff is available 24/7 to answer your technical questions. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to tell us. FRESHEN YOUR SPACE- This Marble Effect Paper provides a more attractive look for any item, and is economical to renovate old furniture in a quick and easy way without having to invest a lot of money. Smooth surface is easy to clean. Great for kitchens, bathrooms, home and office applications. ✨✶✶Tip:✶✶✨ The large size marble contact paper can be better combined with the attached object, and there will be no ugly splicing gap, affecting the overall effect. Because of the large size, we suggest that two people cooperate to paste, the effect will be better. 1.Pattern: Marble 2.Color: Brown Marble 3.Product size: 11.8in X 78in 4.Net weight: 3 oz 5.Packaging size: 12x1.6x1.6 in ✨✶✶Installation Instructions:✶✶✨ Step 1 Wipe down and clean the entire countertop with your choice of cleaner and do a final wipe down with rubbing alcohol. Step 2 Measure and cut out the length of contact paper you need, be sure to measure the piece to be cut atleast 1/2inch larger then the surface that the paper is being adhered to Step 3 Slowly peel the backing little by little with one hand and smooth out the bubbles with the included smoothing tool as you go along. If there is too many bubbles trapped you can always lift the contact paper back up and smooth it again. Step 4 Repeat the process for any other areas that were not covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f7gZ+PC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EBuyers","source_asin":"B08D5R34LJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D5R34LJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D5R34LJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
