window.products.push({"id":607877,"name":"Price Computing Scale, Digital Food Commercial Scale, 88lb/40kg Electronic Counting Scale with RED LED, Lb/Kg/Oz Conversion for Retail Meat Fruit Prod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179UKWpagL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【High precision and precision sensor】: Price Computing Scale adopts high precision and pressure-bearing precision sensor, and it is durable and can weigh up to 88lb/44kg with a weighing accuracy of 5g/0.01lb, so you don't need to worry about inaccuracy. In addition, the electronic scale can also store 4 unit price mode, can accumulate 99 times the total amount, convenient for a variety of products together with the settlement. ✅ 【Kg/Lb/OZ Easy switchable 】: You can quickly convert pounds to kilograms or ounce, which can be applied to farmers market weighing, vegetables, fruits, meat and seafood food, retail stores weighing cheese, bread, candy, groceries, etc. One scale is multi-purpose, giving you the best convenience. ✅ 【Counting Function】: This counting scale can save you time counting small parts and inventory for your business. Reversible pan to hold coins and other small part. Charge a full time can be used for months. Low battery indicator, overload warning, ensure the service life of the commercial scale and safety. ✅ 【Dual-High Light LED Display Shows】: Weight, Unit Price, and Total Price Shown Simultaneously of the Front and Back Operator and Customer Displays. It is easy for sellers or customers to know how many or how much of the produce is on the tray and how much it cost, so that you and your customers can build a higher level of trust and make your sales more efficient. ✅ 【Waterproof Weighing Platform】: The digital commercial food meat weight scale equipped with a waterproof stainless steel top, which is easy for you to clean. With the high-impact material, durable in use and simple to operate, which can greatly improve the efficiency of sales.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179UKWpagL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alltanken","source_asin":"B0C17LV6ZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C17LV6ZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C17LV6ZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
