window.products.push({"id":607919,"name":"EROMMY Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly, Fabric Home Massage Sofa Chairs with Massage and Heat, Wired Remote Control, Side Pocket, Linen Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iPmDSMODL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【8 POINT MASSAGE & LUMBAR HEATING】Our recliner chair is equipped with a wireless remote control. It with 8 Point massage has 3 different vibration intensities and 5 adjustment modes. You can have a full body massage to relax the upper back, lower back, thigh and lumbar. It also has a heating function, which can further promote blood circulation during the massage process. 【HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS】This recliner uses a high-quality metal frame structure that can easily support your body and has a long service life. The padding of high-density soft sponge will bring you great comfort, it can perfectly wrap your body and help you relax your muscles. The breathable PU leather is waterproof and easy to clean, and its delicate and smooth touch provides you with a comfortable touch experience. 【MEET YOUR NEEDS】The lazy boy recliner has many practical functions. There is an angle adjuster on the side of the chair, you can adjust different inclination angles (105°- 170°) according to your preferences and posture. The 160 degree reclining can provide the best comfort, especially for people after a surgery or with back problems. Extending footrest and reclining feature allows you to fully stretch and relax, such as reading, sleeping, watching TV and so on. 【HUMANIZED DESIGN】The powerful silent single motor design enables the lift chairs recliners for elderly to be adjusting to any position smoothly, it can lay back or tilt to stand which can help the elderly stand up easily. The wide armrests and comfortable headrest and backrest fit your body completely. In addition, this chair is equipped with a wireless remote control, which is more facilitates. The side pocket design provides a place for placing the remote control and other small objects. 【USING SUGGESTIONS】For your health, if you have pain in a muscle or joint after prolonged use the power recliner chair, please stop using and consult your doctor. Persistent pain may be a symptom of a more serious condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iPmDSMODL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EROMMY","source_asin":"B09Q658VRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-607919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q658VRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q658VRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
